==Battleground==
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rider (Enemy)|Rider]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**8 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**4 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

